#i-chevron-down"></use></svg></div></button><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-content" id="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:What can you do with this server?" data-collapsible="" data-state="closed" hidden="" dir="ltr" style="--height:0px;--width:0px" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion:_R_5dl335_:trigger:What can you do with this server?" data-orientation="vertical"><div class="prose"><p>This MCP gateway provides hardened web access, Metis verification, and AIMarket capability discovery/invocation.</p><ul><li><p>Fetch a public web page by URL and return its main text, with SSRF protections and <code>&lt;untrusted&gt;</code> wrapping.</p></li><li><p>Search the live web via DuckDuckGo and get top result snippets.</p></li><li><p>Run Metis cognition + verification on an input, returning an answer with <code>verify_score</code>/<code>verified</code> metadata and selectable route.</p></li><li><p>Search an AIMarket hub for priced capabilities by intent, category, limit, and max price without a wallet or key.</p></li><li><p>Invoke a discovered capability on the hub&#x27;s free trial tier, returning output plus a signed receipt nonce and reporting 402 when trial allowance is exhausted.</p></li></ul></div></div></div><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item" data-state="closed" dir="ltr" id="collapsible:accordion:_R_5dl335_:item:Which integrations are available for this server?" data-orientation="vertical" class="_9z9Ih5:-0D1- _Tg8VPc:rpHQ0 _avtN_f:wesUR _mhfxi2:UEach _DY01us:uJbRL _lSowln:9ckOt _r0eJ46:D9cpC _RxKcXV:rJ4k9 _PjAXZs:50HDI _bOJJIv:axlS- _oqDigL:cfhCt _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:a8ScB"><button data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-trigger" type="button" dir="ltr" id="accordion:_R_5dl335_:trigger:Which integrations are available for this server?" aria-controls="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:Which integrations are available for this server?" data-controls="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:Which integrations are available for this server?" aria-expanded="false" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" data-ownedby="accordion:_R_5dl335_" class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:_Cn1F _syDQuH:QGeD- _BhxOP_:peJN1"><span>Which integrations are available for this server?</span><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-indicator" dir="ltr" aria-hidden="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><svg fill="currentColor" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-down"></use></svg></div></button><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-content" id="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:Which integrations are available for this server?" data-collapsible="" data-state="closed" hidden="" dir="ltr" style="--height:0px;--width:0px" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion:_R_5dl335_:trigger:Which integrations are available for this server?" data-orientation="vertical"><div class="prose"><p>Provides live web search via <a href="/mcp/servers/integrations/duckduckgo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">DuckDuckGo</a>, returning top snippets.</p></div></div></div><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item" data-state="closed" dir="ltr" id="collapsible:accordion:_R_5dl335_:item:How do I use aimarket-mcp?" data-orientation="vertical" class="_9z9Ih5:-0D1- _Tg8VPc:rpHQ0 _avtN_f:wesUR _mhfxi2:UEach _DY01us:uJbRL _lSowln:9ckOt _r0eJ46:D9cpC _RxKcXV:rJ4k9 _PjAXZs:50HDI _bOJJIv:axlS- _oqDigL:cfhCt _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:a8ScB"><button data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-trigger" type="button" dir="ltr" id="accordion:_R_5dl335_:trigger:How do I use aimarket-mcp?" aria-controls="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:How do I use aimarket-mcp?" data-controls="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:How do I use aimarket-mcp?" aria-expanded="false" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" data-ownedby="accordion:_R_5dl335_" class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:_Cn1F _syDQuH:QGeD- _BhxOP_:peJN1"><span>How do I use aimarket-mcp?</span><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-indicator" dir="ltr" aria-hidden="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><svg fill="currentColor" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-down"></use></svg></div></button><div data-scope="accordion" data-part="item-content" id="accordion:_R_5dl335_:content:How do I use aimarket-mcp?" data-collapsible="" data-state="closed" hidden="" dir="ltr" style="--height:0px;--width:0px" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion:_R_5dl335_:trigger:How do I use aimarket-mcp?" data-orientation="vertical"><div class="prose"><ol><li><p>Click on &quot;Deploy Server&quot;.</p></li><li><p>Wait a few minutes for the server to deploy. Once ready, it will show a &quot;Started&quot; state.</p></li><li><p>In the chat, type <code>@</code> followed by the MCP server name and your instructions, e.g., &quot;<!-- -->@<!-- -->aimarket<!-- -->-<!-- -->mcp search for recent breakthroughs in AI&quot;</p></li></ol><p>That&#x27;s it! The server will respond to your query, and you can continue using it as needed.</p><p>Here is a <a href="https://glama.ai/blog/2025-07-08-how-to-install-and-use-mcp-servers" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">step-by-step guide with screenshots</a>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="prose _D2yDoP:uSyzt!" id="readme-md"><h1 id="user-content-aimarket-mcp-ecosystem-mcp-gateway">aimarket-mcp — ecosystem MCP gateway</h1><blockquote><p>🔄 Synced from the <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">AI-Factory monorepo</a> (append-only history). <strong>Pull requests are welcome</strong> — merged PRs are imported back and re-synced here. <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/issues" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Issues</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/pulls" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Pull requests</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p>🌐 <strong>English</strong> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/README.ru.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Русский</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/README.es.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Español</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/README.fr.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Français</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/README.zh.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">中文</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/localization-glossary.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Glossary</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><h3 id="user-content-just-want-to-try-the-marketplace-install-nothing">🟢 Just want to try the marketplace? Install nothing.</h3><p>Paste <code><strong>https://modelmarket.dev/mcp</strong></code> into your MCP client and you have <code>market_search</code>
and <code>market_invoke</code> against the live hub, with a few free trial invokes per caller and a
signed receipt for each — no wallet, no key, no install.
→ <code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/hosted-mcp-endpoint.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">docs/hosted-mcp-endpoint.md</a></code></p><p>Install <strong>this</strong> package when you want the other three tools (<code>web_fetch</code>, <code>web_search</code>,
<code>metis_verify</code>), or want to point the market tools at a hub of your own.</p></blockquote><p><strong>One MCP gateway. Six hardened tools. Shared by Metis, ARGUS, and the ecosystem.</strong></p><p>Transport: <strong>stdio</strong> (<code>aimarket_mcp/stdio_server.py</code>) for Glama / Claude Desktop / Cursor, built with the
official <strong>Model Context Protocol</strong> Python SDK (<code><a href="https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">mcp</a></code>, <code>FastMCP</code>).
Also ships <strong>Streamable-HTTP</strong> on <code>:9090</code> for self-hosted deployments (<code>aimarket-mcp-http</code>, Docker Compose).</p><div class="table-wrapper"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Item</p></td><td><p>Location</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MCP entrypoint (stdio)</p></td><td><p><code>aimarket_mcp/stdio_server.py</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MCP gateway (HTTP)</p></td><td><p><code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/aimarket_mcp/server.py" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">aimarket_mcp/server.py</a></code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Tool handlers + security</p></td><td><p><code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/aimarket_mcp/tools.py" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">aimarket_mcp/tools.py</a></code>, <code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/aimarket_mcp/security.py" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">aimarket_mcp/security.py</a></code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Glama / Docker (stdio)</p></td><td><p><code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/Dockerfile" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Dockerfile</a></code>, <code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/glama.json" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">glama.json</a></code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Self-host HTTP</p></td><td><p><code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/Dockerfile.http" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Dockerfile.http</a></code>, <code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docker-compose.yml" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">docker-compose.yml</a></code></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Compatible hosts: Claude Desktop, Cursor, Glama, and any MCP client that supports stdio or Streamable-HTTP.</p><h2 id="user-content-tools">Tools</h2><div class="table-wrapper"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Tool</p></td><td><p>What it does</p></td><td><p>Hardening</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>web_fetch</code></p></td><td><p>Fetch a URL, return main text (readability-lite)</p></td><td><p>SSRF-guarded; output sanitized + <code>&lt;untrusted&gt;</code>-wrapped</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>web_search</code></p></td><td><p>Live DuckDuckGo search → top snippets</p></td><td><p>output sanitized + <code>&lt;untrusted&gt;</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>metis_verify</code></p></td><td><p>Metis cognition + verification envelope</p></td><td><p>returns answer + <code>verify_score</code> / <code>verified</code> gate</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>market_search</code></p></td><td><p>Discover priced capabilities on an AIMarket hub</p></td><td><p>free; no wallet, key or channel; the hub lists only what it can execute</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>market_invoke</code></p></td><td><p>Run one on the hub&#x27;s free trial tier</p></td><td><p>returns the signed receipt nonce; reports the hub&#x27;s 402 verbatim when the allowance is spent</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>market_status</code></p></td><td><p>Show the free trial invokes and prepaid balance left</p></td><td><p>read-only; the hub&#x27;s health, this installation&#x27;s remaining trial in the current window, and the <code>AIMARKET_API_KEY</code> balance when set (never the key)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="user-content-example-buy-a-gaia-open-meteo-reading">Example — buy a GAIA Open-Meteo reading</h3><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">market_search(intent=&quot;gaia weather open-meteo&quot;)
market_invoke(
  capability_id=&quot;gaia.weather.read@v1&quot;,
  product_id=&quot;gaia.gateway&quot;,
  source_hub=&quot;https://iot.modelmarket.dev&quot;,
  # input JSON with device_id om-wx-01 — see tool schema / hub docs
)</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_copdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_copdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><p>Or the same HTTP the tool wraps:</p><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">curl -s -X POST &quot;${AIMARKET_HUB_URL:-https://modelmarket.dev}/ai-market/v2/invoke&quot; \
  -H &#x27;Content-Type: application/json&#x27; \
  -H &#x27;X-AIMarket-Sandbox-Visitor: vis_mcp_om_wx&#x27; \
  -d &#x27;{&quot;capability_id&quot;:&quot;gaia.weather.read@v1&quot;,&quot;product_id&quot;:&quot;gaia.gateway&quot;,
       &quot;source_hub&quot;:&quot;https://iot.modelmarket.dev&quot;,&quot;input&quot;:{&quot;device_id&quot;:&quot;om-wx-01&quot;}}&#x27;</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_cspdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_cspdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><p>That is the <strong>easy</strong> path (trial/sandbox). Proving an <strong>external wallet</strong> paid on-chain
is a separate escrow flow (<code>openChannel</code> → DebitAuthorization → hub debit/settle) —
see <code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/onchain-journal.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">docs/onchain-journal.md</a></code> §3l–§3m and
<code><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/gaia/blob/main/docs/LIVE-RELAYS.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">gaia/docs/LIVE-RELAYS.md</a></code>.</p><p>Why a gateway (not per-agent tools): generic capabilities are written <strong>once</strong>; the security core lives in one audited place. Ecosystem-specific capabilities live in their own MCP servers (<code>aimarket-oracle-gateway</code>, <code>aimarket-plugins</code>).</p><p>Related MCP server: <a href="/mcp/servers/iuiu-py/websearch-forge-mcp">MyWebSearch MCP</a></p><h2 id="user-content-configure-env">Configure (env)</h2><div class="table-wrapper"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>var</p></td><td><p>meaning</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_METIS_URL</code></p></td><td><p>Metis verify API base (default <code>https://metis.modelmarket.dev</code>)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_METIS_KEY</code></p></td><td><p>optional bearer for Metis verify</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_SEARCH_URL</code></p></td><td><p>DuckDuckGo HTML endpoint override</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_HUB_URL</code></p></td><td><p>AIMarket hub for <code>market_search</code> / <code>market_invoke</code> (default <code>https://modelmarket.dev</code>)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_API_KEY</code></p></td><td><p>Credit-account key from the hub&#x27;s <code>/start</code> page (<code>https://modelmarket.dev/start</code>): priced <code>market_invoke</code> calls are paid from its prepaid balance; while it is short the free trial still applies. In HTTP mode it pays for every caller of that server</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_SANDBOX_VISITOR</code></p></td><td><p>Trial identity for <code>market_invoke</code>; random per install, set it to keep an allowance across reinstalls</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_KEY</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP bearer auth key. HTTP requests without a key are refused by default, including direct loopback clients. Configure a key and send <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;</code>; stdio needs no HTTP key. An intentionally anonymous endpoint can instead set <code>AIMARKET_MCP_PUBLIC=1</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_LOCAL_RELAY</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — default off. <code>1</code> explicitly trusts tokenless local TCP callers <strong>including arbitrary proxies/tunnels running as the server&#x27;s user</strong>. Requires a loopback peer and Host, local browser Origin, no forwarding headers and verified same-user socket ownership. Prefer a bearer key; process names and public listeners cannot prove that a request is direct</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_LOCAL_UNVERIFIED</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — default off. On macOS/Windows or another host without Linux socket tables, <code>1</code> additionally bypasses unavailable socket ownership proof. Requires <code>AIMARKET_MCP_LOCAL_RELAY=1</code> as well. Neither setting bypasses a configured bearer key or production mode</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_PUBLIC</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — <code>1</code> answers anonymous callers from anywhere, without a key (an explicit choice for a public endpoint)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_HOST</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — listen address (default <code>127.0.0.1</code>; the HTTP image sets <code>0.0.0.0</code>)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_PRODUCTION</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — <code>1</code> requires <code>AIMARKET_MCP_KEY</code> (fail-closed)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_RATE</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — requests/min per key/IP (default 120)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>AIMARKET_MCP_PORT</code></p></td><td><p>HTTP only — listen port (default 9090)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id="user-content-run-stdio-glama-claude-desktop">Run (stdio — Glama / Claude Desktop)</h2><p>Claude Desktop (<code>mcpServers</code> entry) — no clone, no working directory to get wrong:</p><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">{
  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {
    &quot;aimarket-mcp&quot;: {
      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;uvx&quot;,
      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;aimarket-mcp&quot;]
    }
  }
}</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_dcpdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_dcpdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><p><code>uvx</code> fetches the published package and runs its <code>aimarket-mcp</code> console script, which is
the stdio server. With the package already installed, <code>&quot;command&quot;: &quot;aimarket-mcp&quot;</code> and no
args does the same thing.</p><p>From a checkout, for development:</p><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">pip install -e .
python -m aimarket_mcp.stdio_server</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_dipdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_dipdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><h2 id="user-content-run-http-self-host">Run (HTTP — self-host)</h2><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">pip install -e .
AIMARKET_MCP_KEY=sk-... AIMARKET_MCP_PRODUCTION=1 aimarket-mcp-http   # :9090
# or: docker compose up -d   (uses Dockerfile.http)</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_dmpdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_dmpdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><h3 id="user-content-cursor-claude-streamable-http">Cursor / Claude (Streamable HTTP)</h3><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">{
  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {
    &quot;aimarket-web&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;streamable-http&quot;,
      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;http://127.0.0.1:9090/mcp&quot;,
      &quot;headers&quot;: {
        &quot;Authorization&quot;: &quot;Bearer YOUR_AIMARKET_MCP_KEY&quot;
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_dqpdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_dqpdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><h2 id="user-content-publish-on-glama">Publish on Glama</h2><p>Listing: <a href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">aimarket-mcp</a>.
Glama generates a container from the build settings in its admin panel:</p><div class="table-wrapper"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Field</p></td><td><p>Value</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Build steps</p></td><td><p><code>[&quot;bash scripts/glama_install.sh&quot;]</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>CMD arguments</p></td><td><p><code>[&quot;mcp-proxy&quot;, &quot;--&quot;, &quot;.venv/bin/python&quot;, &quot;-m&quot;, &quot;aimarket_mcp.stdio_server&quot;]</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Placeholder parameters</p></td><td><p><code>{}</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Pinned commit SHA</p></td><td><p>empty (latest synced commit)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Build, inspect, and publish a release after syncing source changes. A repository
sync alone does not refresh the deployed tool catalog or its quality evaluation.
The catalog should contain all six tools listed above.
See <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/GLAMA.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Glama build and release instructions</a>.</p><h2 id="user-content-consumers">Consumers</h2><ul><li><p>Connected successfully? Share your host, configuration, and one working tool using
the <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/show-and-tell-template.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">Show and tell template</a>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Metis</strong> — enable the preset:</p><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">enable_mcp_tools: true
mcp_ecosystem_presets: [aimarket-web]</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_7a6pdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_7a6pdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></li><li><p><strong>ARGUS</strong> — add the server to <code>argus.config.json</code> <code>mcpServers</code> (see that repo).</p></li></ul><h2 id="user-content-test">Test</h2><div class="syntax-highlighter _w1ddk4:6hbOS _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:2YiWp _uetrIO:TpG7X _PHAS7x:LcC1j"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _AoNTSX:9czgF _4409BD:K9B27"><div class="_-AnwEg:wO7wf _Sqa4oB:_duyr _JfGZtK:ZzqvL _iteskk:RAwsF _i2ZWiT:YT--L _dsuBnV:-tTe2 _HxogUb:u-l9b _fuQQx4:fidnW _4409BD:K9B27 _XRP-xG:VnTOU _p8a-Gy:aM8de _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _1sMtV_:Krdp7 _SkBzsg:tdcuf _JZNFJc:AUg_V _8vGfGg:eC0bb _MEbFs1:7ZRAG __6fUBu:P6Zc1 _Usvc0M:8GAsE __NtIDs:Fwd3R _RSJXLX:XdSo9" tabindex="-1"><pre><code class="raw-code">pip install -e &#x27;.[dev]&#x27; &amp;&amp; pytest -q</code></pre></div></div><div class="_RO16FJ:ZfOQC"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:CaqWM _syDQuH:ltgB4 _YHyO_A:Qg8sL _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:Mu-Z- _RO16FJ:ivsgs"><button class="_aNma2B:krSkC _LjjoSS:wfdqN _nRd69H:Gzqxf _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HUyzY _Cr_m0U:5512o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _97NnCm:tEl7x _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:LTYGz _RO16FJ:uFWBm" title="Copy" type="button" data-scope="tooltip" data-part="trigger" id="tooltip:_R_eapdl335_:trigger" data-ownedby="_R_eapdl335_" dir="ltr" data-state="closed"><svg fill="currentColor" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-clipboard"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><h2 id="user-content-registries">Registries</h2><p>See the <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/blob/main/docs/REGISTRIES.md" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">directory submission checklist and current status</a>
before submitting or refreshing a listing.</p><div class="table-wrapper"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Registry</p></td><td><p>Listing</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Glama</strong></p></td><td><p><a href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp</a></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Official MCP Registry</strong></p></td><td><p><code>io.github.alexar76/aimarket-mcp</code> — <code>server.json</code> + GitHub Actions</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>PyPI</strong></p></td><td><p><code>pip install aimarket-mcp</code></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>GitHub Releases</strong></p></td><td><p><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/releases" rel="ugc nofollow" target="_blank">github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/releases</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="_w1ddk4:uiC1T _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:TpG7X _DJEIKl:9b02c _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="tools"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _syDQuH:QGeD-"><h2 class="_Ocpc8R:yfWZ6 _0vvNua:zdhJU">Available Tools</h2><span class="_w1ddk4:iDaqu _Cr_m0U:8tVEQ _Btm_AK:kTMI_ _Ocpc8R:YKzrX _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _DJEIKl:MvriA">5<!-- --> tool<!-- -->s</span></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><details class="_3jPi_F:gUv6J _YqIKTr:i-aEn _JZNFJc:2jGB8 _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="market_invoke_tool"><summary class="_excC10:Yjn68 _akq2iH:OWa1l _IS_uqi:osDiy _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD- _MQJx2I:mwtuQ"><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _ac11qz:-xl9C"><svg class="_z5siZB:oHuRD _pgxS11:HqETg _drhFNn:-0ktT" fill="currentColor" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-right"></use></svg><a href="/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/tools/market_invoke_tool" class="_nRd69H:m9aZV _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _XRP-xG:VnTOU _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _anX-2R:1d1Ns _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">market_invoke_tool</a><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:2px;color:#37a169;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 4px">A</span></span></summary><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk _YHyO_A:4ZY9X _pFxUbJ:ZAK5A"><div class="prose"><p>Run one capability from market_search on the hub&#x27;s free trial tier.</p><p>Returns the capability&#x27;s output plus the nonce of the hub-signed receipt, so the result
is verifiable against the hub&#x27;s published key rather than trusted on faith. A few trial
invokes are granted per installation; after that the hub answers 402 and this reports
that instead of fabricating a result. Paid access needs an on-chain escrow deposit,
which is an operator action and deliberately not available here.</p></div><p>Inputs: capability_id (required), input, product_id, source_hub. Returns: result</p></div></details><details class="_3jPi_F:gUv6J _YqIKTr:i-aEn _JZNFJc:2jGB8 _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="market_search_tool"><summary class="_excC10:Yjn68 _akq2iH:OWa1l _IS_uqi:osDiy _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD- _MQJx2I:mwtuQ"><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _ac11qz:-xl9C"><svg class="_z5siZB:oHuRD _pgxS11:HqETg _drhFNn:-0ktT" fill="currentColor" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-right"></use></svg><a href="/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/tools/market_search_tool" class="_nRd69H:m9aZV _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _XRP-xG:VnTOU _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _anX-2R:1d1Ns _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">market_search_tool</a><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:2px;color:#37a169;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 4px">A</span></span></summary><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk _YHyO_A:4ZY9X _pFxUbJ:ZAK5A"><div class="prose"><p>Discover paid AI capabilities listed on an AIMarket hub, with prices.</p><p>Free — no wallet, key or payment channel. Returns capability_id, product_id, price per
call in USD and a trust score; pass both ids to market_invoke to run one. The hub lists
only capabilities it can actually execute, so an empty result means it genuinely does
not sell that. Set AIMARKET_HUB_URL to point at a different hub.</p></div><p>Inputs: intent (required), limit, category, max_price_usd. Returns: result</p></div></details><details class="_3jPi_F:gUv6J _YqIKTr:i-aEn _JZNFJc:2jGB8 _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="metis_verify_tool"><summary class="_excC10:Yjn68 _akq2iH:OWa1l _IS_uqi:osDiy _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD- _MQJx2I:mwtuQ"><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _ac11qz:-xl9C"><svg class="_z5siZB:oHuRD _pgxS11:HqETg _drhFNn:-0ktT" fill="currentColor" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-right"></use></svg><a href="/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/tools/metis_verify_tool" class="_nRd69H:m9aZV _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _XRP-xG:VnTOU _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _anX-2R:1d1Ns _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">metis_verify_tool</a><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:2px;color:#37a169;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 4px">A</span></span></summary><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk _YHyO_A:4ZY9X _pFxUbJ:ZAK5A"><div class="prose"><p>Run Metis cognition + verification on an input; returns answer plus verify_score/verified.</p><p>Calls the Metis <code>/v1/verify</code> API. Response includes machine-readable metadata
<code>[verify_score=… status=… route=… verified=…]</code> so agents can fail-closed when confidence
is insufficient. Configure AIMARKET_METIS_URL and optional AIMARKET_METIS_KEY.</p></div><p>Inputs: input (required), route. Returns: result</p></div></details><details class="_3jPi_F:gUv6J _YqIKTr:i-aEn _JZNFJc:2jGB8 _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="web_fetch_tool"><summary class="_excC10:Yjn68 _akq2iH:OWa1l _IS_uqi:osDiy _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD- _MQJx2I:mwtuQ"><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _ac11qz:-xl9C"><svg class="_z5siZB:oHuRD _pgxS11:HqETg _drhFNn:-0ktT" fill="currentColor" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-right"></use></svg><a href="/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/tools/web_fetch_tool" class="_nRd69H:m9aZV _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _XRP-xG:VnTOU _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _anX-2R:1d1Ns _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">web_fetch_tool</a><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:2px;color:#37a169;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 4px">A</span></span></summary><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk _YHyO_A:4ZY9X _pFxUbJ:ZAK5A"><div class="prose"><p>Fetch a web page by URL and return its main text content.</p><p>SSRF-hardened (scheme allow-list, private-IP block, per-redirect re-validation, size cap).
Output is sanitized, role-marker stripped, and wrapped in <code>&lt;untrusted&gt;…&lt;/untrusted&gt;</code> before
it can reach a model — safe for agent consumption with explicit untrusted marking.</p></div><p>Inputs: url (required), max_chars. Returns: result</p></div></details><details class="_3jPi_F:gUv6J _YqIKTr:i-aEn _JZNFJc:2jGB8 _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="web_search_tool"><summary class="_excC10:Yjn68 _akq2iH:OWa1l _IS_uqi:osDiy _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD- _MQJx2I:mwtuQ"><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _ac11qz:-xl9C"><svg class="_z5siZB:oHuRD _pgxS11:HqETg _drhFNn:-0ktT" fill="currentColor" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-right"></use></svg><a href="/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp/tools/web_search_tool" class="_nRd69H:m9aZV _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _XRP-xG:VnTOU _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _anX-2R:1d1Ns _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">web_search_tool</a><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:2px;color:#37a169;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 4px">A</span></span></summary><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk _YHyO_A:4ZY9X _pFxUbJ:ZAK5A"><div class="prose"><p>Search the web for current facts and return the top result snippets.</p><p>Uses DuckDuckGo HTML results. Output is sanitized and wrapped <code>&lt;untrusted&gt;</code> like web_fetch.
Prefer this over guessing when the answer depends on recent events or documentation.</p></div><p>Inputs: query (required). Returns: result</p></div></details></div></div><section class="_w1ddk4:uiC1T _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:TpG7X _DJEIKl:9b02c"><h2 class="_Ocpc8R:yfWZ6 _0vvNua:zdhJU">Tool Schema Changelog</h2><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:TpG7X"><p class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d _Ocpc8R:yfWZ6 _p8a-Gy:y6YP2">Recent tool additions, removals, and schema changes observed during successful MCP inspections.</p><p role="status">Loading tool schema changelog…</p><ol class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm"></ol></div></section></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk _PHAS7x:Shh5Y _GLnPRo:VUIJD _Fmfkg3:BSIdK"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:c8BNk"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Hm1eQ"><button class="_O6pAC8:xd5gL _qwbtfS:xJ8mf _YObc22:0WO8r _EEdyv8:kW9FK _obmHWu:6Mi3G _VC1g5F:TW4CE _cDGCcL:yDSro _0wCy2e:Knj6J! _VQTFfT:NMap7 _C1ajkn:TzJK7 _XFGa5T:3Mhfs _78lz1_:LLWjP _Scxpxg:yHrci _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:QX3g0 _Ucco6y:pFNli _Cr_m0U:5512o _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:wXNpy _h64iL6:_Cn1F _Ocpc8R:WeNjd _0vvNua:kCq02 _uetrIO:HMbek _97NnCm:Tx96f _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:OpOx2 _PHAS7x:LcC1j _drhFNn:GR7d1" type="button"><svg fill="currentColor" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-play"></use></svg>Try in Browser</button><a href="/sign-up?returnPath=%2Fmcp%2Fservers%2Falexar76%2Faimarket-mcp" class="_O6pAC8:xd5gL _qwbtfS:xJ8mf _YObc22:0WO8r _EEdyv8:kW9FK _obmHWu:6Mi3G _VC1g5F:TW4CE _cDGCcL:yDSro _0wCy2e:uBTE9! _VQTFfT:NMap7 _C1ajkn:TzJK7 _XFGa5T:X0kIx _78lz1_:_btWR _Scxpxg:yHrci _IS_uqi:osDiy _w1ddk4:HOIN2 _Ucco6y:Wb66d _Cr_m0U:5512o _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:wXNpy _h64iL6:_Cn1F _Ocpc8R:WeNjd _0vvNua:kCq02 _uetrIO:HMbek _97NnCm:Tx96f _syDQuH:ltgB4 _DJEIKl:OpOx