dhJU _ac11qz:-xl9C _1sMtV_:Krdp7">One endpoint for every MCP tool</span></span><span class="_Btm_AK:U-n-z _Ocpc8R:gNxUK _p8a-Gy:EqDQ0 _ac11qz:-xl9C _1sMtV_:Krdp7">Rayrun runs every MCP server behind one URL and holds the credentials. Each call is decided per client, tool, and argument, then recorded.</span></a><span class="_IS_uqi:Z5_O2 _Btm_AK:AmIy7 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:RqcAp _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD-"><span class="_ac11qz:-xl9C _1sMtV_:Krdp7">ray.run</span><a href="/advertise" class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Btm_AK:e_O3A _0vvNua:D74hr _uetrIO:rx5BF _anX-2R:rq9Mq _jztopK:3CtJg _aKr-3X:zhZNG _348YDv:Vbymy _smiGxf:65JlO _BFptE6:DavkT _pVclmn:zDQMu _5fXQO5:N0ZSN _azAE2r:stZ9d _XC54xN:H5Xug _OX368L:bNVrM _aNma2B:gT36y _YTSkkd:VaDGP _PO-Yhb:wGumN _HDhHFP:E3p_D _58FN9j:hMpVe _nRd69H:66X-z _Cr_m0U:L47rT _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:wXNpy _cyfNo6:2DiEc _drhFNn:gEJ_1 _smsbT1:Mfblc _DHvPrl:FtkEh _pgxS11:HqETg">Ad</a></span></div></div><div class="_w1ddk4:uiC1T _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _DJEIKl:9b02c _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="tool-definition-quality"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:TpG7X"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:a8ScB"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _syDQuH:QGeD-"><h2 class="_Ocpc8R:yfWZ6 _0vvNua:zdhJU"><a href="https://tdqs.dev" class="_58FN9j:7T2bX _Btm_AK:Lxv-o" title="Tool Definition Quality Score (TDQS)">TDQS</a></h2><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ"><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:4px;color:#37a169;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 8px">A</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d _Ocpc8R:1nrCd">4.3<!-- -->/5.0</span></div></div><p class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d _Ocpc8R:gNxUK">Scored<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-10-20T10:30:21.033163Z" title="21 days ago">2026-10-20 10:30</time> <!-- -->across <!-- -->5<!-- --> <!-- -->tools</p></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Disambiguation</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">Each tool has a fairly distinct purpose: web_search vs web_fetch (find vs retrieve), market_search vs market_invoke (discover vs execute), and metis_verify is a standalone verification endpoint. The only slight overlap is that market_invoke can run arbitrary hub capabilities while metis_verify runs a specific one, which could raise &#x27;which do I call?&#x27; questions, but the descriptions clarify the difference.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Naming Consistency</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">5<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:100%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">All five tools follow the same {domain}_{verb}_tool snake_case convention (web_search_tool, market_invoke_tool, market_search_tool, metis_verify_tool, web_fetch_tool). The redundant &#x27;_tool&#x27; suffix is unnecessary but applied uniformly, so it remains fully predictable.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Tool Count</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">Five tools is a lean but reasonable set covering search, fetch, market discovery, invocation, and verification. It is on the thin side for a market/hub server since no tool exposes trial quota, hub config, or errors-as-state beyond what invoke returns, but nothing feels padded.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Completeness</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">The core loop is covered: discover capabilities (market_search), run one (market_invoke), verify output (metis_verify), plus web search/fetch for grounding. Minor gaps exist (no tool to inspect remaining trial invokes or hub status), and paid escrow is intentionally excluded, but agents can work around these.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_w1ddk4:uiC1T _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:9RvPx _29n7j_:eB8NH _DJEIKl:9b02c"><h4 class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2">Maintenance</h4><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Hm1eQ"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD-"><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d _Ocpc8R:RqcAp _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _jTiGcq:p7zmt _MjrJkq:mFNmJ">Activity</span><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:gNxUK _0vvNua:zdhJU _uetrIO:Qm-SX" style="cursor:help;text-decoration:underline dotted #2c3335;text-underline-offset:4px"><span aria-hidden="true" class="_Cr_m0U:D_pwI _pgxS11:HqETg _97NnCm:aYsD_ _RO16FJ:mH4St" style="background:#00d992"></span>Active</span></div><div aria-label="Commits per week over the last 12 weeks" class="_IS_uqi:ubbAh _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:kgiBe" role="img" style="height:20px"><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#1b2326;height:2px" title="Week of 2026-08-23: 0 commits"></div><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#1b2326;height:2px" title="Week of 2026-08-30: 0 commits"></div><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#1b2326;height:2px" title="Week of 2026-09-06: 0 commits"></div><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#1b2326;height:2px" title="Week of 2026-09-13: 0 commits"></div><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#1b2326;height:2px" title="Week of 2026-09-20: 0 commits"></div><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#1b2326;height:2px" title="Week of 2026-09-27: 0 commits"></div><div class="_Cr_m0U:L47rT _cM4iKr:vRE2_" style="background:#37a169;height:3